upgrades:
- building:
    - camp     (default)
    - barrack  (glory, unlocks gates)
    - fort     (+glory, unlocks +1 garrison)
    - fortress (++glory, unlocks tall gate, unlocks both +2 garrisons, requires iron gate)
- entry:
    - none       (default)
    - door       (defence)
    - short gate (+defence, unlocks tall characters, unlocks fort)
    - tall gate  (++defence, unlocks giant characters)
- garrisons:
    - none  (default)
    - one   (+1 garrison, requires fort)
    - two   (+2 garrisons, requires fortress)
    - three (+2 garrisons, requires fortress)

characters:
- village:
    - girl      bring more coins, slower
    - boy       bring less coins, faster
    - woman     heal unit in front
    - man       cheap but weak brawler
    - grandma   healing buff radius
    - grandpa   damage buff radius
    - hunter    ???
    - fisherman ??? hook someone up a lane

campaign:
- 1 ZoneField - welcome! the game developer told us that you have to fight Something Somewhere to save the
                world in a true game-like fashion, but we don't know what or where because we are just dumb villagers!
                don't let our stupidity fool you - we are big hearted, so we will help you however we can!
                let's start with the basics...
                ---
                now we will be returning to our dumb simple lives -
                luckily, our problems cannot even reach the closeby town that is abandoned!
- 2 ZoneRuins - or is it... i knew it smelled like trouble... --- we should probably follow the slimey trails...
- 3 ZoneSwamp - ew! these must be the things that destroyed that overgrown town ---
                we're getting closer - it's getting warmer...
- 4 ZoneDesert - a bit too warm... --- the docks nearby will help us escape this oven...
- 5 ZoneDocks - across the ocean, far from the heat... --- the ocean breeze is getting colder...
- 6 ZoneGlacier - a bit too cold... i guess we got a bit too far from the heat... --- we've looked all across the world...
                  where could this Somewhere be...
- 8 ZoneCave - perhaps it's underground? --- deeper?
- 7 ZoneMine - it's getting warmer... --- even deeper?
- 9 ZoneHell - a bit too deep... and a bit too warm...
               but that looks like the Somethings from the Somewhere those villagers were talking about!